  "title": "Pepperoni Penne",
  "description": "This snappy sauce starts with sautéed slices of spicy pepperoni with shallots and garlic added to the pan. Chopped tomatoes, cream, and parsley jump in for a quick simmer before merging with hot pasta. Grate Parmesan over the top to finish.",
  "authors": [
